        "content": "**Jaeger** http://localhost:16686 · **Prometheus targets** http://localhost:9090/targets · **Grafana** http://localhost:3001 (admin/admin)\\n\\nScrapes: Api `:5080`, CloudShield `:5081`, NetworkGuard `:5082`, Outbox `:9180`, Fulfillment `:9181`, Reconciliation `:9182`, Notification `:9183`, **ResultsWorker `:9184`**. Console Serilog includes `Service`, `CorrelationId`, `TraceId`, `SpanId`."
